  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Weidemeyer2009 groups272,301-302 as A.cf.gregaria. Body anchored272; missing posterior wing process conservatively interpreted from302 Fig16 plus same taxon description. Retain cf identification. Not complete preserved272, not exact reconstruction or a scan. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"body_height_z\": 0.1, \"preserved_272_wing_width\": 0.0615, \"working_reconstruction_width\": 0.0615, \"working_depth_y\": 0.034, \"basis\": \"p194 table specimen272 H100.0mm, width61.5mm incl.wing. 302 height30mm only1.5whorls and35mm width NOT imported into reconstruction.\", \"uncertainty\": \"272 measured dimensions anchor overall surviving body; reconstructed wing shape/proportions and depth are inferred, not fossil measurements. Fit replacement process within conservative existing width envelope, do not claim final shape measured.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Weidemeyer2009 groups272,301-302 as A.cf.gregaria. Body anchored272; missing posterior wing process conservatively interpreted from302 Fig16 plus same taxon description. Retain cf identification. Not complete preserved272, not exact reconstruction or a scan. {\"units\": \"meters\", \"body_height_z\": 0.1, \"preserved_272_wing_width\": 0.0615, \"working_reconstruction_width\": 0.0615, \"working_depth_y\": 0.034, \"basis\": \"p194 table specimen272 H100.0mm, width61.5mm incl.wing. 302 height30mm only1.5whorls and35mm width NOT imported into reconstruction.\", \"uncertainty\": \"272 measured dimensions anchor overall surviving body; reconstructed wing shape/proportions and depth are inferred, not fossil measurements. Fit replacement process within conservative existing width envelope, do not claim final shape measured.\"}"
  },
